{"id":"d3bad961f35df52a","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-zfc-filter7-fubini-product.md","title":"ZFC Filter7 Fubini Product","display":"df-zfc-filter7-fubini-product — ZFC Filter7 Fubini Product","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-filter7-fubini-product","aliases":["58-df-zfc-filter7-fubini-product"],"display":"df-zfc-filter7-fubini-product — ZFC Filter7 Fubini Product","depends_on":["[[../batch14/58-df-filter-set.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-product.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-filter7-fubini-product"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-filter7-fubini-product</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-filter7-fubini-product — ZFC Filter7 Fubini Product"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5a7d94a7a7f8209a\" href=\"?note=5a7d94a7a7f8209a\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-filter-set.md\">../batch14/58-df-filter-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3579e07be41aa5cd\" href=\"?note=3579e07be41aa5cd\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-product.md\">../batch10/58-df-product.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\">\\(X,Y\\)</span> (underlying sets)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal G\\subseteq\\mathcal P(Y)\">\\(\\mathcal G\\subseteq\\mathcal P(Y)\\)</span> (set filters)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal H\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X\\times Y)\">\\(\\mathcal H\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X\\times Y)\\)</span> (candidate product filter)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Filter}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Filter}_S\\)</span> (set-filter predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5a7d94a7a7f8209a\" href=\"?note=5a7d94a7a7f8209a\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-filter-set.md\">../batch14/58-df-filter-set.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FubiniProduct}\">\\(\\operatorname{FubiniProduct}\\)</span> (predicate defined below)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter7\\text{-}fubini\\text{-}product} \\vdash \\operatorname{FubiniProduct}(\\mathcal H,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal G,X,Y)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Filter}_S(\\mathcal F,X)\\land\\mathrm{Filter}_S(\\mathcal G,Y)\\land\\mathcal H=\\left\\{A\\subseteq X\\times Y:\\left\\{x\\in X:\\{y\\in Y:\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in A\\}\\in\\mathcal G\\right\\}\\in\\mathcal F\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter7\\text{-}fubini\\text{-}product} \\vdash \\operatorname{FubiniProduct}(\\mathcal H,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal G,X,Y)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Filter}_S(\\mathcal F,X)\\land\\mathrm{Filter}_S(\\mathcal G,Y)\\land\\mathcal H=\\left\\{A\\subseteq X\\times Y:\\left\\{x\\in X:\\{y\\in Y:\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in A\\}\\in\\mathcal G\\right\\}\\in\\mathcal F\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Membership is determined by taking the <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal G\">\\(\\mathcal G\\)</span>-large vertical sections and requiring their index set to be <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F\">\\(\\mathcal F\\)</span>-large.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"li